v2.1 28.02.2022 byd Pøidán funkèní blok fbOpenWeatherMap2

{ENU}
v1.0 2012-09-03 nem First edition
v1.1 2012-09-20 nem Added test of HTTP answer (200 OK)
                    Item for icon code was added into T_YAHOO_WEATHER_DATA
