v1.9 2019-01-07 nem Into fbYrWeatherToYahoo added conversion of weatherData.forecast[i].iconCode
v2.0 2021-11-22 nem The fbYahooWeather(), fbYrWeather() and fbYrWeatherToYahoo() blocks 
