__DECL FUNCTION IDC_TO_CZECH : bool
(*`{ENU} Translations description of the weather from English to Czech language based on variable condCode for server OpenWeatherMap.
  This function returns TRUE when translation is successful
  {CSY} Pøeklad popisu poèasí z anglického do èeského jazyka na základì promìnné condCode pro server OpenWeatherMap.
